## Error Handling Commands

```bash
:: If push rejected
git pull origin main --rebase
git push

:: If conflict occurs
git add .
git rebase --continue
git push

:: If remote already exists
git remote remove origin
git remote add origin https://github.com/riyaashukla30/Digital-Nurture-Exercises.git
```

